P('word-for-word','A reduplicative compound of word + for + word; it means preserving every word exactly or repeating an utterance exactly.',[
 C('word-for-word.s1','书面','The translator made a word-for-word version of the warning, keeping its unusual phrasing intact.','译者逐字翻译了这则警告，保留了其中不寻常的表达。','a word-for-word translation / copy','Adjective: reproducing the original words in the same order without additions or omissions.','The translation deliberately preserves exact wording.'),
 C('word-for-word.s2','通用','She repeated the station announcement word-for-word so the late passengers would hear the exact platform number.','她一字不差地复述了车站广播，让晚到的乘客听清准确站台号。','repeat / quote something word-for-word','Adverb: with every word repeated exactly.','The announcement is repeated without changing any words.')],[M('He quoted the warning word-for-word but replaced every sentence with his own summary.','He paraphrased the warning in his own words.','Replacing the wording with a summary is paraphrasing, not repeating word-for-word.')],[
 Q('word-for-word.q1','word-for-word.s1','meaning','What did the translator preserve?','The original wording and order.','Only the general topic.','The page’s font and margins.','Word-for-word means exact wording, with no omission or addition.'),
 Q('word-for-word.q2','word-for-word.s2','context','Why did she repeat the announcement exactly?','So passengers heard the precise platform number.','To change the platform number.','To make the announcement shorter.','Exact repetition preserves important details.'),
 Q('word-for-word.q3','word-for-word.s1','grammar','In “a word-for-word translation,” what does the compound modify?','translation','station','passengers','It is a compound adjective describing the translation.'),
 Q('word-for-word.q4','word-for-word.s2','distinction','Which action is word-for-word?','Repeating every sentence exactly as heard.','Summarizing the main idea in new phrases.','Translating only the title.','Exact repetition keeps the original wording.')]);
P('wording','From word + -ing; it names the particular words chosen to express an idea, including the phrasing of a document.',[
 C('wording.s1','语言','The wording of the invitation sounded warm but made the start time unmistakably clear.','邀请函的措辞听起来亲切，同时把开始时间写得十分明确。','the wording of a notice / invitation','Noun: the choice and arrangement of words used to express something.','The wording is the invitation’s phrasing.'),
 C('wording.s2','法律','The lawyer challenged the wording of the clause because it could be read as limiting the tenant’s rights.','律师质疑该条款的表述，因为它可能被理解为限制租户的权利。','the wording of a clause / contract','Noun: the exact phrasing of a legal or formal document.','The legal meaning turns on the clause’s precise phrasing.')],[M('The lawyer challenged the clause’s wording because the sentence contained no words at all.','The lawyer challenged the clause’s wording because its phrasing was ambiguous.','Wording is the choice of words in a phrase or document.')],[
 Q('wording.q1','wording.s1','meaning','What sounded warm and clear?','The invitation’s choice of words.','The start time by itself.','The paper’s color.','Wording means the words chosen to express a message.'),
 Q('wording.q2','wording.s2','context','Why did the lawyer challenge the clause?','Its phrasing could limit the tenant’s rights.','It was written on wool.','It contained a correct train timetable.','The legal interpretation depends on exact wording.'),
 Q('wording.q3','wording.s1','distinction','Which item can be revised without changing a document’s basic topic?','Its wording.','Its woodlot.','Its wool.','Wording is the phrasing, which can be edited.'),
 Q('wording.q4','wording.s2','collocation','Which phrase is natural?','the wording of a contract clause','the wool of a contract clause','the woods of a contract clause','Formal clauses have wording that can be interpreted.')]);
